P2	S3	unjust_contrary_law	kind conceptual
P3	S3	unjust_contrary_law → rules_just
P4	S4	subjection_cw
P5	S4	subjection_cw → only_cw_makes
P6	S4	no_other_way_obey
P7	S4	no_other_way_obey → signs_required
C2	S3	rules_just	from P2 P3
C3	S4	only_cw_makes	from P4 P5
C4	S4	signs_required	from P6 P7
A1	-	laws_to_addressed ∧ rules_just ∧ only_cw_makes ∧ signs_required → def_evident
C1	S1	def_evident	from P1 C2 C3 C4 A1
A2	-	def_evident → O ack_deduced
